  hiredMemo: Tanner's first act as VP was installing a pool in the meeting room.
    His second was expensing a jet ski. The CEO is delighted. The shareholders are
    not. Tanner has scheduled a 'vision meeting' on a yacht. Nobody knows where the
    yacht is.
